---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---
<LegalLayout title="Support — Kuchi">
  <h1>Kuchi support</h1>
  <p>For help with the collection or agent connection, contact <a href="mailto:support@kalarislabs.com">support@kalarislabs.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>Connection help</h2>
  <p>Use <code>https://kuchi.kalarislabs.com/mcp</code> as the MCP server URL. No sign-in or token is needed. If your client still asks for authentication, remove the connection and add it again with no authentication.</p>
  <h2>Report an issue or content concern</h2>
  <p>Include the reference title or source link, your agent client, and what happened. Do not send passwords, access tokens, client secrets or private account content.</p>
  <p>Kuchi supplies references and metadata. Rendering and editing use your own video tools. Engagement numbers are dated source-platform snapshots.</p>
  <p>Kuchi has no accounts. See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <p><a href="/">Back to the collection ↗</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
